{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的部分心理转折交代得比Y简略，尤其从反复犹豫到决定往前过，Y把动机和前后衔接讲得更充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句和放大高亮让我听着音乐也能迅速抓住每段的核心矛盾，感受又穿插在叙述之间，配合到时出现的细节，更容易跟着音乐体会情绪怎样一点点变化，而不是只看到情绪标签。Y的叙述更连贯，人物为什么舍不得、为什么害怕、又为什么决定继续往前，交代得更自然，整条心理变化也更像一件事。但在有限的扫屏时间里，Y需要连续读较长的句子，部分感受还集中堆在某一句旁边，因此X实际更容易同时抓住要点和具体感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "be477bb2-56e4-4ff1-9f77-be2e13747eef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060014901746Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:01:02.506859+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ab4b4d652bba9d55ffcbeac6329bc4d5f51ce809b184b8231f8e90a697dd91e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we